  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000qixr](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000qixr) Magnitude 6.3 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Jun 08 2025 68km NE of Villavicencio. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 4.5125 longitude -73.1444. It impacted 64113 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
